  "catalog_course_description": "This course aims to survey cutting-edge research in psychological sciences. Faculty members take turns in discussing with students research articles in their area of expertise that reflect current trends, novel research directions, and hot debates in psychological sciences —including social,developmental, and cognitive psychology as well as neuroscience",
  "course_learning_outcomes": [
    "to build academic breadth outside of students' immediate research area",
    "to familiarize students with the ongoing research programs in faculty labs"
  ],
  "course_objective": "Learn recent psychological research trends",
